id: telepathic-read
name: Telepathic Read
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: Combat Telepath's mark beside Mind Read, on the reader's clock.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Read by a Combat Telepath: their Combat Rolls against you 1(bT) higher until the end of their next turn.
text: >
  Telepathic Read: Combat Telepath's mark - "increase your Combat Rolls by 1(bT) against them until the end of your next
  turn."
